{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-9f1175a7-4565-4f0f-902c-a9415b4552dc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8c63d014c957351","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-8007-c38t3ptf/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-8007-E005.md","content":"# Implement Feature Store Create Form Wizard\n\n## Description\n\nReact form wizard (PatternFly 6) in odh-dashboard that lets a platform administrator deploy a new `FeatureStore` instance by filling out a guided form mapped to the `FeatureStore` CRD (feast.dev/v1) — no YAML editing or CLI access required. The wizard implements the decided TP field set with schema-driven validation, submits through the existing `/api/k8s/*` pass-through using the user's own token, is restricted to admin users, and operates fully in disconnected/air-gapped environments. Implemented after the prototype-alignment assessment, the form field-scope decision, and the approved UXD designs.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Guided form wizard covering the decided TP field set: namespace selection, registry type, online store backend, offline store backend, authorization mode, and scaling parameters\n- Client-side input validation derived from the CRD OpenAPI schema, with inline guidance for required fields, valid backend combinations, and scaling prerequisites; form fields validated against the CRD OpenAPI schema at build time (CRD version-bump mitigation)\n- Submission of a valid `FeatureStore` CR via the existing `/api/k8s/*` pass-through; if the K8s API rejects the CR, the server-side validation error is surfaced in the form\n- Admin-only access to the create flow (dashboard admin-status check / `secureAdminRoute` pattern); create action not available to viewer users\n- All form options, validation rules, and UI assets bundled in the dashboard's static assets — no external network fetches (air-gapped support)\n- Feature-flag gating of the wizard surface\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- A platform admin can complete the wizard and submit a valid `FeatureStore` CR from the dashboard with no YAML editing or CLI access, with the form rendering all decided TP fields without error\n- Invalid input (required fields, unsupported backend combinations, scaling prerequisites) is blocked before submission with inline guidance\n- A K8s API rejection of a submitted CR is surfaced as an actionable error in the form\n- Non-admin users cannot access the create flow\n- The wizard functions on a disconnected cluster with no external network access — no form options, validation rules, or UI assets require external connectivity\n- The wizard surface is hidden unless the feature flag is enabled\n- Create/delete operations succeed end-to-end through the pass-through with the extended dashboard ClusterRole (integration with the RBAC manifest change)\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- P0: deploy a new FeatureStore instance from the dashboard via a guided form wizard\n- P2: inline form validation guidance for CRD schema constraints (bundled — same form surface and validation logic as the P0 wizard)\n- P1: viewer read-only (admin-only create access)\n- P1: air-gapped operation (bundled form options and validation)\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":55901,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac68a93886bffd55","agent_id":"a40e7c224b2cca3e1","session_id":"0ef27685-1ed8-4b23-8ac0-1ea621901635","uuid":"5961ce68-8a29-4a50-858c-86b867bb57fa","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:47:05.893Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007"}
