diation work in the feast-operator would be add-on scope (add_remediation) not covered by an epic here.\n99\t- **RBAC coordination**: E004 (manifests) runs parallel to the frontend epics in the same repo; integration (CRUD succeeding with the extended ClusterRole, flag gating the UI) is verified via the frontend epics' ACs — merge-order coordination risk only.\n100\t\n101\t## Tiered Delivery\n102\t\n103\tNot applicable. No external dependency with uncertain timing: all internal dependencies (CRD, operator, dashboard proxies, ClusterRoles) already exist; PatternFly 6 is already vendored at the required version. The prototype PR is a reference, modeled as an Investigation gate rather than an external blocking dependency.\n104\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9be413476f1a86f","agent_id":"a885c71eb67262f30","session_id":"0ef27685-1ed8-4b23-8ac0-1ea621901635","uuid":"d9eb0737-242c-4922-88fd-8d523cbceceb","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:50:47.656Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8fdbb4cc32bc5c21","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
