roduction)\n36\t- Deliver a field-set and validation-constraint specification for the create wizard\n37\t\n38\t## Acceptance Criteria\n39\t\n40\t- A field-set specification exists listing every `FeatureStore` CRD field exposed in the TP wizard, with rationale for any excluded fields\n41\t- Restricted or unsupported backend combinations are enumerated with user-facing guidance\n42\t- The decision is confirmed by the PM and Feature Store Engineering\n43\t\n44\t## HLR Traceability\n45\t\n46\t- P0: guided form wizard field coverage (this decision defines the wizard's scope)\n47\t- P2: inline validation guidance for CRD schema constraints (this decision defines the constraint source)\n48\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90eae1365c80b058","agent_id":"ab79cda22a64c12c2","session_id":"0ef27685-1ed8-4b23-8ac0-1ea621901635","uuid":"fab716ac-ba7f-4c6b-a969-2498190fc68a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:00:40.227Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8843df8ed3e5647","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8007"}
