 columns; create/delete actions), the read-only detail view, and the delete confirmation dialog\n44\t- Interaction patterns: deployment-status polling and readiness display, admin vs viewer control visibility, form validation and error display\n45\t- Disconnected-environment considerations — no external assets or network-dependent UI elements\n46\t- A design specification ready for frontend implementation, following the dashboard's PatternFly 6 design system\n47\t\n48\t## Acceptance Criteria\n49\t\n50\t- Wireframes exist for all four surfaces (wizard, list, detail, delete dialog), covering admin and viewer states\n51\t- Wizard wireframes reflect the decided TP field set and restricted backend combinations\n52\t- Designs follow the dashboard's PatternFly 6 design system\n53\t- The design specification is reviewed and signed off through the UXD review process\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\t- Supporting: P0 create wizard, management list, inspect view, delete (design input to the frontend implementation)\n58\t- P1: viewer read-only browsing (viewer-state designs)\n59\t- P1: air-gapped operation (no external assets in designs)\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90eae1365c80b058","agent_id":"ab79cda22a64c12c2","session_id":"0ef27685-1ed8-4b23-8ac0-1ea621901635","uuid":"b501d6d8-9e26-440f-b825-26cba1bac1b9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:00:43.660Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8998b2908c047cb6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8007"}
